msgstr "Skandeer tweede model"

#: src/onboarding.py:718
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Kon nie die tweede model opneem nie"

#: src/onboarding.py:719
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Jou eerste model is gestoor, so gesigaanmelding werk reeds. Die kamer moet "
"steeds helder genoeg wees om jou gesig te sien - verander die lig eerder as "
"om dit af te skakel - probeer dan weer, of slaan oor en voeg 'n model later "
"by Instellings."

#: src/onboarding.py:753
msgid "Second scan: glasses, facial hair or different lighting"
msgstr "Tweede skandering: bril, gesigshare of ander beligting"

#: src/onboarding.py:755
msgid ""
"First model saved: face login already works. A second model makes "
"recognition more reliable when something changes: put on the glasses you "
"sometimes wear (or take them off), or record it with different facial hair, "
"and change the light — turn a lamp on or off, move away from the window. "
"Keep your face clearly visible and press Scan again; the same short guided "
"capture follows."
msgstr ""
"Eerste model gestoor: aanmelding met jou gesig werk reeds. 'n Tweede model "
"maak herkenning meer betroubaar wanneer iets verander: sit die bril op wat "
"jy soms dra (of haal dit af), neem dit op met ander gesigshare en verander "
"die lig — skakel 'n lamp aan of af, beweeg weg van die venster. Hou jou "
"gesig duidelik sigbaar en druk weer Skandeer; dieselfde kort begeleide "
"opname volg."

#: src/onboarding.py:797
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan jou {} outomaties ontsluit met gesigstawing (bespeurde "
"beursie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> Gaan tans TPM-hardeware en -nutsgoed na..."

#: src/onboarding.py:817
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan jou {} outomaties ontsluit met gesigstawing (bespeurde "
"beursie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> TPM-hardeware bespeur. Installeer tans <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"outomaties..."

#: src/onboarding.py:829
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan jou {} outomaties ontsluit met gesigstawing (bespeurde "
"beursie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> Hardeware TPM 2.0 aktief. Jou wagwoord sal veilig binne "
"die TPM verseël wees."

#: src/onboarding.py:831
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan jou {} outomaties ontsluit met gesigstawing (bespeurde "
"beursie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> TPM-hardeware bespeur, maar outomatiese installering van "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> het misluk. Begin <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</"
"code>. Terugval na sagteware-gebaseerde geloofsbriewe-kas."

#: src/onboarding.py:833
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan jou {} outomaties ontsluit met gesigstawing (bespeurde "
"beursie: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> Geen TPM-hardeware bespeur nie. Gebruik sagteware-"
"gebaseerde geloofsbriewe-kas (AES-256-GCM)."

