#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Foto's van jou gesig waarmee Ubuntu Hello vergelyk word. Hou ten minste "
"twee, aangeteken in verskillende beligting."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Wys tans gestoorde modelle vir:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Slegs een gesigmodel is geregistreer. 'n Bril, ander gesigshare of ander "
"beligting verander hoe die kamera jou gesig sien, sodat 'n enkele model kan "
"misluk (byvoorbeeld saans onder lampe). Voeg 'n tweede model by met of "
"sonder bril, met jou ander voorkoms of in ander lig sodat ontsluiting "
"betroubaar bly."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Voeg 'n tweede model by"

