#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"'n Werkskermkennisgewing wys terwyl Ubuntu Hello na jou gesig soek, en "
"rapporteer dan die resultaat. Mislukte pogings bly in die kennisgewinglys."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Wys kennisgewings"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Een kaart per gesigstawingpoging, opgedateer in plek met die resultaat."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Kennisgewing klink"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Speel die stelselklank vir 'n herkende of mislukte poging."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Sluit diagnostiek in"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Voeg die model, sekerheid teenoor drempel, rame, kamera en tydsberekening by "
"elke kaart. Nuttig wanneer 'n probleem gerapporteer word."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sekuriteit"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Hoe presies jou gesig moet ooreenstem, en of Ubuntu Hello jou vra om te "
"bevestig dat jy werklik daar is."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Strengheid van gesigherkenning"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Vinnig"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Gebalanseerd"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Veilig"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Vra my om te knik om te bevestig"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Nadat jou gesig herken is, vra 'n kennisgewing jou om te knik. 'n Foto wat "
"voor die kamera gehou word, kan nie knik nie."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Sleutelring / KWallet Outo-ontsluit"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer gesigstawing om outomaties jou aanmeldsleutelring of KWallet by "
"aanmelding te ontsluit. Dit stoor jou wagwoord veilig verseël in die TPM "
"wanneer dit beskikbaar is, of geïnkripteer met AES-256-GCM met 'n root-"
"alleen-hoofsleutel. Gesigsauthoring stel PAM_AUTHTOK vir pam_gnome_keyring "
"of pam_kwallet5, afhangende van jou rekenaar."

